      "content": "\"a pointless existence\"... that's harsh. but i guess it's true. i don't even know what the point of trying to change would be. what change is there? just a different job? a different city? it's all just more of the same loop. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just stuck in this cycle forever.",
